@@ -95,7 +114,7 @@ Improvements
 
 - `#9741 <https://github.com/pytest-dev/pytest/issues/9741>`_: On Python 3.11, use the standard library's :mod:`tomllib` to parse TOML.
 
-  :mod:`tomli`` is no longer a dependency on Python 3.11.
